								"description": "Any member. The payer doesn't have to be a participant.\n\n- `splitType`: `EQUAL` (default), `EXACT`, `PERCENTAGE` or `SHARES`. Each participant's `value` is left out for EQUAL, and is the amount / percentage / number of shares for the others.\n- `amount` is in the group's currency, with at most its decimals (2 for EUR, 0 for JPY), else **400**.\n- Payer and participants must be group members, else **400** with `errors.paidById` / `errors.participants`.\n- `date` is optional (defaults to today).\n\n10.01 split equally between 2 people doesn't divide exactly, so one random participant gets the extra cent: 5.01 + 5.00.\n\nThe pre-request script makes sure you're in a group together with `{{memberEmail}}`.",
								"body": {
									"mode": "raw",
									"raw": "{\n    \"description\": \"Dinner\",\n    \"amount\": 10.01,\n    \"paidById\": \"{{userId}}\",\n    \"splitType\": \"EQUAL\",\n    \"participants\": [\n        {\n            \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"userId\": \"{{memberId}}\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"date\": \"2026-10-01\"\n}",
